  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 买保险这事儿の不完全靠谱指南·下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65aa2ee1a310a0e29e0345fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65aa2ee1a310a0e29e0345fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jan 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>「本期内容」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>这里是《不知名海浪》👋🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年春节我本人首要任务，给爸妈买保险！但！“我到底该给爸妈买啥？这投保须知+健康告知一看，还是能给我爸妈买的吗？这个价格买了真的合适吗？如果真的需要赔付，要怎么做？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以...当听到身边竟然有位小伙伴转行入了保险圈子，立马就请来进行我们的不完全靠谱指南系列第二弹！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期特邀嘉宾天天，带领我和阿真进入保险新手村刷攻略~由于保险知识的海洋真的深，一期没能讲完！所以也首次分为了上下期进行，本期重点进行购买前的小白疑问解答，及到底怎么买的实操性攻略秘籍~上期有对保险整体进行了认知性的科普哦，想了解可以点击直达</span><em><span> </span></em><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658efa9520d779b49d176c47" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658efa9520d779b49d176c47"><em><span>Vol.14 买保险这事儿の不完全靠谱指南·上</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期主播」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>@橙子 @阿真</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>@天天</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「时间线」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 不同年龄段的人，应该买什么保险？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 遗产继承也需要买保险？（🤔三个意想不到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 给父母买保险的难处大讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 健康告知到底要怎么告知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 买了保险后，保费断缴了怎么办？宽限期和终止期都是啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 保险公司黄了，我买的保险还能正常理赔吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> 没钱交保费了，还可以有减额交清这种操作？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 挑选保险的重要要素（如何买，分几步走！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2429">40:29</a> 有可能花最少钱，保最全保障吗？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期音乐」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>Holiday--平井 大</span></p><span></span><p><span>Too Much to Ask--Moonchild</span></p><span></span><p><span>You Can Do It--Johnny Stimson</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq4HKuKLhx2CpCDtKAXVQLq74tF4.m4a" length="50256018" type="audio/mp4"/>
