    <title>Vol.6换乘不换乘？韩国人到底能把恋综玩出什么花样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63af10594ded9d81d0a11ef8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63af10594ded9d81d0a11ef8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Dec 2022 16:22:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>「本期内容」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>这里是《不知名海浪》👋🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>你最近看恋综了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋爱综艺从某一刻开始，已经成为了追综人不可缺少的电子榨菜&amp;心动胶囊。而韩国恋综从火出现象级的《heart signal》开启了素人恋爱大战后，这两年的恋爱综艺，光是细数节目名都数不过来...</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，我们一起聊了聊韩国的恋综发展史，以及我们最爱的《换乘恋爱》！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（这期也是2022年的最后一期啦，希望大家2023年都好运换乘，健康快乐！）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期主播」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>@橙子</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>@Erica （刻板印象主播）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「时间线」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 细数近两年井喷的韩国恋综</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> 韩国恋综大考古，你你还记得《情书》吗🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 一个《我结》倒下去，千千万万个我结站起来...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 《换乘恋爱》的惊艳亮相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 关于换乘的细腻镜头叙事感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2724">45:24</a> 换乘第1季和第2季的不同之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3298">54:58</a> 如果可以参加《换乘恋爱》，两位主播...</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期音乐」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>SUN OR SUCK--WOODZ </span><em><span>（换乘恋爱第1季主题曲）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>WHAT IF--姜昇植</span><em><span>（换乘恋爱第2季主题曲）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>Everything You're Asking--Selamo/moon</span></p>]]></description>
