  <item>
    <title>Vol.4 仪式感是什么小饼干，能吃吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634a4a09e67030aadb38f6fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634a4a09e67030aadb38f6fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Oct 2022 05:50:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>「本期内容」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>这里是《不知名海浪》👋🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>仪式感是什么？真的有什么卵用吗？但如果没有那些属于我/属于你的充满着“无关紧要”仪式感的时刻，又是什么填满了人生的缝隙呢...</span></p><span></span><p><span>(这期节目录制的时候还是夏末，现在上海已经是深秋了...我们经历了一段播客的疲惫期，但重振旗鼓了！）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「两位</span></strong></em><strong><span>“重仪式感"主播</span></strong><em><strong><span>」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>@橙子 @阿真</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「时间线」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 仪式感到底是个什么东西？似乎很难被定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 阿真和橙子的仪式感小事分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 仪式感=消费陷阱吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 仪式感和使日常美好小习惯以及强迫症的边界？这些美好小习惯配不配叫仪式感呢🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> 仪式感的“枷锁感”“束缚性”，关于婚礼这个“大仪式”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> 阿真的“羞耻”仪式感小事👂🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> 男孩子就普遍缺少仪式感吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 仪式感是一种有用美学</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「本期音乐」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>Lost in summer--幕后来电CurtainCalls</span></p><span></span><p><span>Time Traveling--Anthony Lazaro/Sarah Kang</span></p><span></span><p><span>Anniversary--TAOTAK</span></p>]]></description>
